to move\", \"Space or click to swap\", \"Press R or click Restart\". According to spec.\n\nBut we must check the design in DESIGN.md. It mentions move (steer the dot continuously), tap (swap). So controls: \"Arrow keys or WASD to move the dot\", \"Tap (click or Space) to swap dot and echo\", \"Press R or click Restart\". In typical guidelines, typical controls: use Arrow keys / WASD for movement, Space or Click for swap, R for restart.\n\nThe meta.json must have \"tags\": maybe [\"arcade\",\"echo\"] or something lower-case: \"arcade\", \"swap\", \"echo\". We'll include some tags.\n\nNow implement index.html. Should include minimal placeholder script (empty). Must include style, but not required to be elaborate; but the validator expects no runtime errors. So script can contain nothing or maybe placeholder comments. But it's okay to have empty script. However we must also expose window.__game object probably required later, but not for task1 as they only need to load without console errors; may need to expose something else? The \"observable contract\" is required later. For now task 1 only scaffold, doesn't need that. It just must not error upon load. So empty script that doesn't error is fine.\n\nBut the meta.json must conform.\n\nThus we need to write the two files.\n\nWe'll write index.html as per CONVENTIONS. Provide style like body margin 0, background #0a0a0f, color etc to avoid errors. Provide header classes, canvas etc. The script can be empty (or just comment). Ensure closing tags.\n\nWill also need to ensure <script> block at end of body before </body>. Provide placeholder comment.\n\nNow using write tool.\n\nBefore writing, we need to \"read\" suggested existent file? There is none, but we can just write.\n\nMake sure file paths absolute: /tmp/slop-factory-work/echo-swap-29b861a4/index.html and meta.json.\n\nUse write tool.\n\n","time":{"start":1778480734183,"end":1778480761664}}}
